      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "CAWBOURNE AUDRY (2) stalked the lead and fought on well to finish 1.3 lengths away in second (30.36) at this track in a Grade 5 over 525m. Good beginner aided by a nice draw. Makes plenty of appeal. PAW XEROS (5) was a little disappointing last start at Wentworth Park when 5th (30.15) over 520m. Has won here at this journey. Safe beginner but has a tricky box to overcome. Has ability and a bold showing is expected. MUDDY DUCK (1) was game in defeat off the inside draw last start, finishing second and beaten a nose (30.67) behind CAWBOURNE ELSIE at this track. Although beaten ran one of the quickest times on the card last start. Will give a great sight again. CAWBOURNE TIFF (8) can finish much closer after missing a cheque at this track last start.",
